      <h2 id="choosing-your-stack">Choosing Your Stack</h2>
      <p>Most sites do not need every tool on this list. Match the stack to your stage:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>New site (&lt;50 pages, budget-constrained):</strong> Google Search Console + Screaming Frog free tier covers indexing and technical audits completely. Add a paid tool only when you are publishing weekly and competing for defined keywords.</li>
        <li><strong>Independent site or blog publishing weekly:</strong> One audit-and-monitoring workbench — SeeO or a Semrush/Ahrefs entry tier — plus Surfer-style optimization if you write competitively. This is the "one morning dashboard" setup: health score, rank movements, and a prioritized fix list in one view.</li>
        <li><strong>Content team (3–10 people):</strong> Ahrefs or Semrush for data authority, Surfer SEO for the optimization pass, and Screaming Frog licensed for quarterly deep audits and any migration.</li>
        <li><strong>Agency / consultant:</strong> The full stack — a suite for client reporting, a crawler for raw audit evidence, and an AI workbench like SeeO for ongoing client health monitoring across many projects.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>One warning regardless of stack: no AI SEO tool replaces editorial judgment. Audit prioritization and content scoring compress the mechanical work, but which pages deserve consolidation, which keywords match your actual expertise, and what original value a page adds are still human calls. Learn more about our <a href="/how-we-test/">testing methodology</a> and <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.</p>

      <h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details>
          <summary>What are the best AI SEO tools in 2026?</summary>
          <p>The best AI SEO tools in 2026 depend on the job. Ahrefs and Semrush are the strongest all-around suites for keyword research, backlink data, and site audits. Screaming Frog remains the deepest technical crawler. SeeO stands out as an AI-powered audit workbench that connects keyword research, rank tracking, technical audits, and content optimization in one place. Surfer SEO is the leading on-page content optimizer, and Google Search Console is the free foundation every site should run.</p>
