        <details>
          <summary>Can AI do a full SEO audit?</summary>
          <p>AI can run and prioritize the mechanical parts of an SEO audit — crawling, detecting broken links, duplicate titles, missing meta descriptions, redirect chains, and thin content — faster than any human. Tools like SeeO, Semrush, and Screaming Frog surface and prioritize these issues automatically. Human review is still needed for strategy decisions: which pages to consolidate, which keywords to chase, and how to fix issues without breaking existing rankings.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Are AI SEO tools worth the cost for small sites?</summary>
          <p>For small sites, start with Google Search Console and a free crawler — they cover the basics at zero cost. A paid tool pays for itself once you publish regularly and need keyword research, competitor tracking, and content optimization in one workflow. Solo bloggers typically need one paid tool, not an entire stack.</p>
