        <details>
          <summary>How do AI SEO tools actually use AI?</summary>
          <p>Modern SEO tools apply AI in three main ways: clustering keyword data and detecting search intent at scale, prioritizing audit issues by estimated impact instead of raw severity, and benchmarking draft content against the current top-ranking pages for topic coverage and structure. The result is less manual spreadsheet work and faster decisions, though the underlying crawl and index data still comes from traditional crawling and SERP data providers.</p>
